id: DRAFT-tnftpd-20231001-autotools-ohos-triplet-and-hmdfs-shim-adaptation
trigger_tool: make|conan
trigger_tool: make|conan|configure|sh
phase: configure|compile|package
error_signature: Invalid configuration .* system `ohos' not recognized|config.status: error: could not setup config files machinery|working directory cannot be determined|can't fork - try again|Error 64|EX_USAGE|install-dist_exampleDATA
error_signature: Invalid configuration .*not recognized|could not setup config files machinery|working directory cannot be determined|can't fork|Out of memory|Error 64|EX_USAGE
severity: 3
category: autotools, portability, ohos, hmdfs, build-system, compat, limitation
match_keywords: autotools_configure, configure failed, config_sub, ohos_triplet, hmbs_platform_capabilities, readonly_tmp, install_shim, ex_usage, config_shell, can't fork, enomem, compile_error
title: autotools 栈 OHOS 真机平台微载适配：ohos 三元组缺失、HMDFS 只读/tmp 与 mktemp fork 不可用、CONFIG_SHELL getcwd 失败、install shim 多源 EX_USAGE 统一修复
root_cause: autotools 系配置链在 OHOS 真机的 HMDFS/受限 shell 上逐环暴露四个平台微载缺口：(1) config.guess/sub 的 KERNEL-OS/OS 后缀表缺 ohos 三元组判 Invalid configuration；(2) configure/config.status 以 umask 077 + mktemp 建的临时目录在 HMDFS 只读/tmp 与 fork 不可用下不可写；(3) 前导 CONFIG_SHELL 重执行把进程切到 getcwd 失败的 hnp bash 致 working directory cannot be determined；(4) HMBS 注入的 install shim 只收单文件两参，automake 批量多源安装 exit 64 (EX_USAGE)
affected_scope: 依赖完整 autotools 栈（config.guess/sub + autoconf 2.6x configure + automake install 规则）在 OHOS 真机（HMDFS、/bin/sh 受限、install_shim:true）构建的 C/C++ 库
verification_cmd: 真机日志保留 configure/compile/package 全阶段真实结果：config.sub 对 aarch64-unknown-linux-ohos RC=0 原样输出；configure/config.status 无 Permission denied；CONFIG_SHELL/SHELL=/bin/sh 直驱无 working directory cannot be determined；make install 走 cp/mkdir shim 全量安装无 EX_USAGE
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: unified-autotools-ohos-platform-adaptation
rec_description: 组合补丁 + env 直驱 + 本地 shim 的统一套路：config.guess/sub 补 ohos 三元组、configure 临时目录 mkdir fallback + umask 022、CONFIG_SHELL/SHELL 强制 /bin/sh 跳过 hnp bash 重执行、package 内写 cp/mkdir install shim 并递归重定向生成 Makefile 的 INSTALL 变量
rec_command: patches/0001-config.guess-ohos.patch + 0002-config.sub-ohos.patch 补 linux-ohos*/ -linux-ohos*；0003-configure-hmdfs-umask.patch 把 mktemp→false 强制 mkdir fallback 且 umask 077→022；build() 用 CONFIG_SHELL=/bin/sh SHELL=/bin/sh sh configure 并 _setup_fs_env() 置可写 TMPDIR/PWD/SHELL；make/install 追加 SHELL=/bin/sh；package() 写 cp/mkdir install shim 并递归重定向 build-release/ 各 Makefile 的 INSTALL 路径
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: conan-recipe-plus-patches
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: fork-minimal-build-mode
fallback_description: 若 configure 早期参数解析反复 fork expr/sed 触发瞬时资源耗尽，保持配方零改动（发行包自带 configure、-j1、/bin/sh、无 conan 依赖），按环境性故障留证据等待真机复跑
fallback_auto_fix: false
forbid_1_pattern: Invalid configuration .*not recognized.*"status":"passed"|working directory cannot be determined.*"status":"passed"
forbid_1_reason: 禁止在 ohos 三元组缺失或 CONFIG_SHELL getcwd 失败等平台微载缺口未修复时放行；门禁要求 configure 全阶段真实通过
forbid_1_consequence: 真机预检 evidence incomplete，fortune: true
forbid_1_consequence: 真机预检 evidence incomplete，任务退回修复循环
similar_to: [DRAFT-radvd-autotools-hmdfs-readonly-tmp, DRAFT-libradsec-autotools-ohos-triplet-consumer]
